    <!-- PROPOSED: trail pole ratio m (dimensionless); trail time constant length = sigma_y/m. Basis: neutral value 1.0 (trail lags the effective angle by one lateral relaxation length), chosen without data; the pole of equations 69-70 is tire-specific in the paper. -->
